      "value": "Well, well, i forgot again the camera is still in photo mode while streaming.\n\nAnd AGAIN.... why no different case color? All modes just showed same white camera box. And that is confusing which mode your camera is in while running around if you're busy and paying not much attention.\n\nJust make it possible, its sooooooo easy fix and i will happy. Really!",
