  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now, i discovered i forgot today turn it back from Photo to Steam camera.\n\nWhat happened here why i did forgot it?\nBecause both camera's are identical.\n\nPlease give different color case for Photo camera, like yellow, blue or so. So i can see it's photo or stream type.\nThat will avoid easier to forgot turn it to stream version.\nMight have different color for each function.",
